{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"docs/claxbot-surfaces/contract.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-12T09:34:06.814770Z","id":"e2e8e49f15594dcbef17d608e5ca19ebf6ccb913a5e4f48f65f4c2b7a0d4749f","body":{"detail":"crates/clax-bot/src/bot_surfaces.rs:1413-1420 refuses any reader_view (docs/contract.md:10438 says the same, and the fixture's own script step at :980-995 shows it refused), yet the example a host copies first carries one. The wire round-trip test (crates/clax-surface/src/tests/wire/mod.rs) passes because the type accepts the member. The native daemon sets content from Store::keeps_bot_content (crates/clax-http/src/state.rs:477), true for the fs store, and the fixture's script shows nothing withheld. Other places where the examples disagree: the MessageResponse for seq 2 says waiting: true while the events deliver messages [1, 2] at step 3 before `parked` at step 4; run-2 ends gave_up as e2 in one ServeResponse and stopped/cancelled as e5 and in its RunState; docs/contract.md:10816-10863 shows seq 2 waiting: false and messages: [2].","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":31},"end":{"line":45},"content_hash":"580ed779703b255826670ea2184045c7677a7286ecf41380dde04f0547b86de9"},"suggested_fix":"Drop reader_view from the first RegisterRequest, show an empty withheld (or say which store withholds snapshot), and make the message/event examples tell one run's story.","summary":"The fixture's first RegisterRequest gives `reader_view: \"none\"`, which the daemon refuses `invalid_settings`, and its Registered answer (:55-66) and docs/contract.md:10401-10402 show `snapshot` withheld for `content`, which no daemon serving these routes withholds","tags":["review","docs","fixture","session:claude-code:443e6ffa-9215-48fe-9313-5be76354ae11"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"docs/claxbot-surfaces/contract.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-12T10:27:18.655228Z","id":"2ecc132333dda8976f807195680e8ad0375084a6177cbb5abb1746ea5fe9942e","body":{"detail":"The manifest RegisterRequest gives no reader_view; the Registered with a withheld snapshot is removed and docs/contract.md's Registering example shows none; MessageResponse seq 2 is waiting: false, a third message (seq 3) is waiting: true, matching events that give [1, 2] at step 3 and park at step 4 and the parked RunState's messages_waiting 1; the stopped/cancelled RunState and end e5 are run-3's, as e3 is. docs/contract.md's messages example gives [1, 2] and a third while parked. clax_surface_lib_test (every_message_of_the_fixture_is_written_as_it_is_read) passes. Proposed close for the owner.","kind":"comment","references":"e2e8e49f15594dcbef17d608e5ca19ebf6ccb913a5e4f48f65f4c2b7a0d4749f","summary":"Fixed in 445b54810: the fixture and the contract tell one daemon's story","tags":["session:claude-code:443e6ffa-9215-48fe-9313-5be76354ae11"]}}
